Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Pro 64-bit (10.0, Build 26100), NVIDIA Driver 572.16, RTX 4070 GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nNVIDIA Driver 572.16 is creating major rendering artifacts for the 2D Forward+ renderer in-editor as well as in-game.\n\n**Forward+ In-Game**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db4895d0-b89f-4b12-9c07-92ec7e0ecf9a)\n\n**Compatibility In-Game**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dafe05c8-3d05-4973-97fa-50529f368160)\n\n**Forward+ In-Editor**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aa1d46b-33f8-4c45-bb82-cf5d0cbf3fcc)\n\nNote the artifact on the left side of the script folder.\n\n**Compatibility In-Editor**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7e3ae6e-6699-42ab-9f00-ee6bd9fde284)\n\nThe artifacts are less noticeable in high resolution 2D games. My game renders at resolution 640x360 with stretch mode \"viewport\".\n\nI have also confirmed that it is not an issue on just my machine, at least 1 playtester of my game is having this exact issue for the exported game.\n\nWill do some testing to see if there's a specific graphics option responsible, but otherwise I'm unsure how to proceed other than to force OpenGL rendering.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Update to NVIDIA driver 572.16\n- Run the editor in Forward+ mode, or run a game in Forward+\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followe